# apps/study/.npmrc
#
# Same conflict, same workaround as apps/web/.npmrc: openapi-typescript@7.13.0
# (devDep behind `generate-types`) declares a peer of typescript@^5.x, and this
# repository is on typescript@~6.0.2 on purpose. Without this line, `npm ci` and
# `npm install` fail with ERESOLVE before installing anything.
#
# Drop it when openapi-typescript >= 8.x ships with official TS 6 support — the
# same trigger that retires the web app's copy. Track:
#   https://github.com/openapi-ts/openapi-typescript/issues
legacy-peer-deps=true
